        "created_at": "2014-08-31T19:02:38.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I count the Pylons as non-enemies of Baron Blade so they don't suffer from Redirector or Disruptor, but no as allies because yeah, 7d defense is ridiculous.</p>",
